Package: folio-show
Version: 3.0.0
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 24000
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, folio-fonts
Recommends: cups-client, xdg-utils, fonts-dejavu-core, wl-clipboard
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: ribbon presentations app
 Folio Show is a presentations app with a ribbon interface, .pptx as its native
 format, and an engine of its own: it reads and writes the format directly,
 lays the slides out and draws them without a toolkit under it. Slides with
 layouts and masters, shapes and text boxes, typing in place, bold, italic and
 alignment, notes, and a full-screen show driven from the keyboard.
 Everything stays on this computer.
